  "Tuesday: two blocks of 8 × 20 s all-out. Thursday: the full Norwegian 4×4 at 159–178 bpm.": "Tiistai: kaksi lohkoa 8 × 20 s all-out. Torstai: koko norjalainen 4×4 nopeudella 159–178 bpm.",
